            "sorted_list: [5, 4, 3, 2, 1]\n"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "And there we have it, a Python toolkit of lists and strings!"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "Eqee6C2Yfg0s"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Lesson Summary"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "uQeaWJEkfloo"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "You've navigated through Python collections, primarily focusing on Lists and Strings, learning how to create, access, and manipulate them via various operations."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "dJwq5reCf112"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
